## Invoice Payment Model — NET30

All GemCutter sales invoices are issued on 30-day payment terms, confirmed by the current invoice register (INV-2026-051, -058 and -060 all have exactly 30 days between issue and due date). The forecast models cash inflows as prior-month billings collected in the following month.

